{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03022","headline":"题画山水障 · 张九龄","name":"题画山水障","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心累犹不尽，果爲物外牵。\n偶因耳目好，复假丹青妍。\n尝抱野间意，而迫区中缘。\n尘事固已矣，秉意终不迁。\n良工适我愿，妙墨挥岩泉。\n变化合羣有，高深侔自然。\n置陈北堂上，仿像南山前。\n静无户庭出，行已兹地偏。\n萱草忧可树，合欢忿益蠲。\n所因本微物，况乃凭幽筌。\n言象会自泯，意色聊自宣。\n对玩有佳趣，使我心渺绵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}